{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "改动与盲签",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 99.1,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "第四种，新增的函数，绕过了原有的检查。",
   "spoken": "第四种，新增的函数，绕过了原有的检查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 5.556
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "2023 年 3 月，Euler Finance 损失约 1.97 亿美元，大部分后来归还。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 3 月，Euler Finance 损失约 1.97 亿美元，大部分后来归环。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 5.98,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 6.07,
   "speechEnd": 12.093
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "根因是新加的捐赠函数，没有做健康检查。",
   "spoken": "根因是新加的捐赠函数，没有做健康检查。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 12.52,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 12.617,
   "speechEnd": 16.258
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "别的入口都检查了，偏偏新入口漏掉了。",
   "spoken": "别的入口都检查了，偏偏新入口漏掉了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 16.66,
   "dur": 3.44,
   "speechStart": 16.66,
   "speechEnd": 19.884
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "识别信号是，新增了一个能改余额或债务的入口。",
   "spoken": "识别信号是，新增了一个能改余额或债务的入口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 20.32,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 20.32,
   "speechEnd": 24.367
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "防御是统一的操作后检查，所有入口都要经过，再用不变量测试兜底。",
   "spoken": "防御是统一的操作后检查，所有入口都要经过，再用不变量测试兜底。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 24.78,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 24.78,
   "speechEnd": 30.649
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "第五种，改动过的分叉和新版本，没有重新审计。",
   "spoken": "第五种，改动过的分叉和新版本，没有重新审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 31.08,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 31.08,
   "speechEnd": 35.012
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "2021 年 4 月的 Uranium Finance，分叉了 Uniswap V2。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 4 月的 Uranium Finance，分叉了 Uniswap V2。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 35.46,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 35.566,
   "speechEnd": 40.402
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "改手续费时，漏改了一个常数，恒定乘积的检查就此失效，损失约 5000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "改手续费时，漏改了一个常数，恒定乘积的检查就此失效，损失约 5000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 40.88,
   "dur": 8.08,
   "speechStart": 40.88,
   "speechEnd": 48.707
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "识别信号只有一句话，只改了一行。",
   "spoken": "识别信号只有一句话，只改了一航。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 49.18,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 49.18,
   "speechEnd": 51.992
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "防御是改动即重审，对差异做审计。",
   "spoken": "防御是改动即虫审，对差异做审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 52.44,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 52.44,
   "speechEnd": 55.917
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "第六种，签名人看不懂自己签的是什么。",
   "spoken": "第六种，签名人看不懂自己签的是什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 56.34,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 56.432,
   "speechEnd": 59.751
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "2024 年 7 月的 WazirX，签名人看到的，和签下的不一致，损失约 2.3 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 7 月的 WazirX，签名人看到的，和签下的不一致，损失约 2.3 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 60.16,
   "dur": 8.56,
   "speechStart": 60.265,
   "speechEnd": 68.551
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "2025 年 2 月的 Bybit，多签前端的脚本被精准篡改，只对目标地址生效。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 2 月的 Bybit，多签前端的脚本被精准篡改，只对目标地址生效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 68.94,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 69.045,
   "speechEnd": 75.02
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "签名人盲签了一笔 delegatecall，按 FBI 口径，损失约 15 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "签名人盲签了一笔 delegatecall，按 FBI 口径，损失约 15 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 75.48,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 75.57,
   "speechEnd": 80.892
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "TRON 上的权限诈骗也是这一种，用户签下的，是交出自己账户的权限。",
   "spoken": "TRON 上的权限诈骗也是这一种，用户签下的，是交出自己账户的权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 81.3,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 81.3,
   "speechEnd": 86.586
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "识别信号是，签名界面只显示哈希或摘要。",
   "spoken": "识别信号是，签名界面只显示哈希或摘要。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 87.04,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 87.04,
   "speechEnd": 90.984
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "防御是独立解码，在硬件钱包上核对，delegatecall 只许指向白名单里的合约。",
   "spoken": "防御是独立解码，在硬件钱包上核对，delegatecall 只许指向白名单里的合约。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep28/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
